    "summary": "A woven cotton &#039;country cloth&#039; made up of panels, approximately 20cms in width, stitched together.  The textile is decorated with a series of nested borders worked in natural un-dyed cotton, dark brown and sand-coloured dyed cotton.  The inner border features a repeated hair-comb motif and a geometric design that frames an un-dyed panel in the centre.  This panel features two lozenges with internal alternating geometric motifs. The top and bottom of the cloth has a fringe.",
